 		</member>
+		<member name="text_icon" type="String" setter="set_text_icon" getter="get_text_icon" default="&quot;&quot;">
+			A text glyph displayed in the icon slot when [member icon] and the [theme_item icon] are not assigned. When empty, the [theme_item text_icon] theme string is used instead.
